notes.content:
Bugs have been fixed in the game:
1. The sound was not turned off in the game settings;
2. With any result of the game - a notification was issued that the player set a record (even if it is not a record);
3. When changing the font in the game settings, an achievement was issued in which it was said that the player received more than 7000 points in each of the game modes. Now it is displayed correctly, but I had to add another achievement to the game!
